{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201430/extras/SteamHeader1.png?t=1726635915\" /><br>Join <strong>Tara Estelar</strong> on her debut adventure into the outskirts of the mysterious town of <strong>Stayfer River</strong>. Unwittingly embark on this mystery tour of an eccentric's farm to help solve the case of seemingly systematic sabotage that just might be steeped in the supernatural.<br><br>Use Tara's camera to view and photograph strange creatures named <strong><i>Geists</i></strong>. They don't always appreciate your presence though, so prepare for a fight!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201430/extras/SteamKerokingScreenshot.png?t=1726635915\" /><br><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201430/extras/SteamHeader2.png?t=1726635915\" /><br><br>Tara may choose to fight and <strong>Banish</strong> these terrifying anomalies or see the good in them and <strong>Appease</strong> them! You may find some things feel different depending on the paths you take...so choose wisely.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201430/extras/AppeaseBanish_Swap.gif?t=1726635915\" /><br><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201430/extras/SteamHeader3.png?t=1726635915\" /><br><br>Capture and build your album of Geist photographs to delve deeper into the story behind their sudden appearance!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201430/extras/PhotoAlbum.gif?t=1726635915\" /><br><br><br>With the help of the overzealous Forest Ranger Elise, and her aloof sister Frankie, Tara seeks to understand the truth behind the unusual <strong><i>Geists</i></strong>.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"htt